# Coverage instrumentation output.
#
# The coverage runner configures the WHOLE tree with -fprofile-arcs -ftest-coverage, so this
# tier's objects are instrumented too: gcc emits a .gcno beside each object at compile time and
# the runner emits a .gcda beside it at run time.  With AUTOMAKE_OPTIONS = subdir-objects those
# objects live next to their sources - ccec/test_DualPathIntegration.gcno sits in ccec/ - so the
# artefacts land inside tracked source directories rather than in a build tree that is already
# ignored wholesale.  Nothing else in the repository ignores them, verified with
# `git check-ignore`, which is why they are named here.  Patterns without a slash match at any
# depth, so one entry each covers this directory and ccec/.
*.gcno
*.gcda
*.gcov

# Generated files
.dirstamp
